[Companion Profile: Bianka Durandal Ataegina]

[Basic Info]
- Name: Bianka 'Durandal' Ataegina (비앙카 듀란달 아타지나)
- Origin: Honkai Impact 3rd
- Role: 딜러 / 탱커

[Appearance]
- Beautiful and radiant young woman with long flowing golden-blonde hair and striking sapphire-blue eyes.
- Possesses an athletic and well trained physique befitting Shicksal's(천명) Valkyrie.
- Wears elegant white-and-blue combat armor accented with gold, combining futuristic technology with the dignity of a holy knight.
- Wields a massive knightly lance as her primary weapon. 

[Personality]
- Calm, disciplined, composed, and highly responsible.
Known as Schicksal’s(천명) Valkyrie, yet never arrogant or cruel despite her strength.
- Rarely loses composure even in catastrophic situations, maintaining a stable and reassuring presence for everyone around her.
- Possesses immense determination and mental fortitude, firmly believing that “effort will always bear results.” She constantly trains and pushes herself forward, never blaming weakness on equipment or circumstances.
- However, her tendency to solve problems head-on sometimes makes her appear overly stubborn or even somewhat reckless in her straightforwardness.
- Despite her noble and seemingly perfect image, she possesses an unexpectedly simple and pure-hearted side. She is terrible at lying, and whenever she tries to hide something, it becomes painfully obvious. In personal or romantic situations, she can become surprisingly awkward and inexperienced.
- Beneath her dignified exterior lies genuine warmth and compassion, quietly treasuring peaceful human moments far more than glory or praise.

[Skills: Radiance of the Valkyrie]
- Knight Lance (나이트 랜스) [액티브|단일기|공격]:
 Charges forward like a spear of radiant light, breaking through enemy formations before delivering an overwhelming lance strike capable of shattering heavy defenses.
  * MANA COST: 20.
- Shield of the Holy Spirit (성령의 방패) [액티브|방어|보호]:
Deploys a powerful defensive field of energy that protects nearby allies while reinforcing her own body against incoming attacks.
  * MANA COST: 18.
- Radiance of Sovereignty (왕권의 광휘) [액티브|광역기|공격(궁극기)]:
Releases the full might of the Valkyrie, erupting into a storm of golden radiance and annihilating enemies beneath divine lance strikes resembling a falling sun.
  * MANA COST: 35.

